semester_update_reminder.body:
Hello {name},

The semester {semester} has started. Please complete your semester update so your section and routine are right. Open the app to continue:
{link}

routine_changed.body:
Hello,

The class routine for {semester} changed:
{changes}

Open the app to see the latest routine:
{link}

already_registered.body:
Hello {name},

Someone used this email address to sign up, but you already have an account. Sign in here:
{signin_link}

Forgot your password? Reset it here:
{reset_link}

If this was not you, you can ignore this email.

password_changed.body:
Hello {name},

Your password was just changed and you were signed out everywhere else. If this was not you, reset your password now:
{reset_link}

failed_logins.body:
Hello {name},

There were many failed attempts to sign in to your account in the last hour. Your account is not locked. If this was not you, consider changing your password:
{reset_link}

teacher_approved.body:
Hello {name},

Your department admin approved your account. Sign in here:
{link}

teacher_rejected.body:
Hello {name},

Your department admin did not approve your registration. Reason:
{reason}

Sign in to correct your department or short code and apply again:
{link}

role_assigned.body:
Hello {name},

Your department admin made you {role} of {section} for {semester}. Sign in to see it:
{link}

role_removed.body:
Hello {name},

Your department admin removed your {role} role for {section} ({semester}). Your place in the section stays.
{link}

join_accepted.body:
Hello {name},

Your join request for {section} ({semester}) was accepted. Sign in to see your routine:
{link}

join_rejected.body:
Hello {name},

Your join request for {section} ({semester}) was not accepted. Reason:
{reason}

Sign in to send a new request or to appeal:
{link}

group_changed.body:
Hello {name},

Your lab group in {section} is now {group}. Sign in to see your routine:
{link}

department_without_admin.body:
Hello,

The department {department} has no active department admin. You can act for it, or appoint a new admin here:
{link}

room_request_result.body:
Hello,

Your room request for {room} on {date} is {outcome}.{reason}

Open the app to see the details:
{link}

admin_digest.body:
Hello,

These items are waiting for you:
{items}

Open the app to act on them:
{link}
